From c61769245dd632a3c4b80c193bb02d7b14b9f28c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yuzu <yuzu23234@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:11:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] libcamera: qcom: add native LG rear AWB engine and EEPROM
 calibration

Implement the factory LG AWB pipeline for the rear cameras (IMX363, IMX351, S5K3M5), including calibrated colour transforms, cached gray-zone polygon geometry and classifier constants, vectorized reference distance calculations, scene aggregation, history and target selection, OHE/DTB/FOE/SCD/FWB corrections, face-assist tracking, temporal convergence, startup/frame cadence, manual white-balance locus projection, and EEPROM calibration.
